*
*  ( Internal state variables )
*  0.0      VARIABLE   r1Volt
*  0.0      VARIABLE   r1Cur
*  0         VARIABLE   nTime
*  0         VARIABLE   nTimeCur
*
*
* .( Loading the voltmeter.. )  cr
*
